---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ScrambledTextGenerator from '../../components/tools/ScrambledTextGenerator';

title: "在线乱序文字生成器 (Typoglycemia)"
description: "免费在线乱序文字生成器，基于 Typoglycemia 原理打乱单词内部字母顺序，但仍可阅读，支持中文和英文。"
technologies: "React, TailwindCSS"
category: "tool"
order: 25
---

<Layout title="在线乱序文字生成器 (Typoglycemia)" description="免费在线乱序文字生成器，基于 Typoglycemia 原理打乱单词内部字母顺序，但仍可阅读，支持中文和英文。">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        乱序文字生成器
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        "研表究明，汉字的序顺并不定一能影阅响读"。利用人脑的自动纠错能力，生成看似混乱实则可读的趣味文本。
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
      <ScrambledTextGenerator client:only="react" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain-circuit"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"/><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"/><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"/><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"/><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"/><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"/><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"/><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.97-1.375"/><path d="M17.97 16.625A4 4 0 0 1 16 18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">脑补阅读</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">基于 Typoglycemia 现象，只要首尾字母正确，中间乱序也不会影响阅读理解。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-languages"><path d="m5 8 6 6"/><path d="m4 14 6-6 2-3"/><path d="M2 5h12"/><path d="M7 2h1"/><path d="m22 22-5-10-5 10"/><path d="M14 18h6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">中英支持</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">不仅支持英文单词内部乱序，也能对中文词组进行相邻字交换，效果自然。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shuffle"><path d="M2 18h1.4c1.3 0 2.5-.6 3.3-1.7l14.2-13.9c.5-.7.2-1.7-.7-1.7H19"/><path d="m2 5 6.6 7.2c.8 1.1 2 1.7 3.3 1.7h1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">实时转换</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">输入文字后立即生成乱序结果，每次点击刷新按钮都会生成不同的乱序组合。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
